      "observation": "Full rectangular grid and both axes visible. Three lines labelled a, b, c. Line a rises through the y-axis at 2 and through (2,5); line b falls through (0,2), (1,0), (2,-2). Line c falls shallowly through (0,-3) and (-4,-2), with x-intercept -12. The right x arrow and bottom grid are present."
