      "observation": "Full grid, axes and two lines a and b visible. Horizontal ticks labelled -4,-2,0,2,4,6,8,10; unit squares between those labelled ticks. Line a rises shallowly through (0,-2) and (10,0), so its slope is 1/5. Line b descends through (0,1), (1,-1), (2,-3), so its slope is -2. The y=-2 label belongs to the vertical axis, not x=-4."
    },
